OL,3,GNEWSAOn-the-run fraudster loses #90m
OL,4,Aconfiscation appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne of the UK's most prolific tax
OL,7,Ffraudsters has lost his appeal against
OL,8,Fa judge's order to repay more than #90m
OL,9,Fhe gained through his crimes.
OL,11,FArif Patel, from Preston, ran an
OL,12,Finternational organised crime group,
OL,13,Fwhich stole tens of millions of pounds
OL,14,Fof public money through a complex tax
OL,15,Ffraud.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,404,400,260,160,0,100
