OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAOn-the-run fraudster loses #90m
OL,4,Aconfiscation appeal
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe fled the UK in 2011 and has never
OL,7,Freturned, but was eventually convicted
OL,8,Fin his absence of offences including
OL,9,Fconspiracies to cheat His Majesty's
OL,10,FRevenue and Customs (HMRC), the
OL,11,Fimportation and sale of counterfeit
OL,12,Fgoods and money- laundering.
OL,14,FIn a written judgment on Tuesday, the
OL,15,FCourt of Appeal rejected his claim that
OL,16,Fthe size of his property empire, which
OL,17,Fhad been seized by the court-appointed
OL,18,Freceiver in 2010, had not kept pace
OL,19,Fwith inflation and that the judge's
OL,20,Forder had been disproportionate.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
